Usage: mockserver lint [-hV] [--json] [--strict] <file>...
Check expectation JSON files for expectations that can never match or will not
match as written. Advisory: nothing is changed, and no server is needed.
      <file>...   JSON file(s), each a single expectation or an array of
                    expectations. Several files are checked together, in the
                    order given, as --init loads them.
  -h, --help      Show this help message and exit.
      --json      Print the report as JSON, in the PUT /mockserver/lint format,
                    with each issue's file.
      --strict    Also exit with status 1 when a warning is found (by default
                    only an error, such as an invalid expectation or an
                    unreadable file, does).
  -V, --version   Print version information and exit.
